 6467| MODE is clear, the memory address is to user memory space, and the value of the
 6468| MODE bit is reflected on the DslO P bus signal. The .usr option specifies that the
 6469| memory access must be to the user address space regardless of the mode bit (user
 6470| or supervisor) in the PSR. The .usr option is privileged and only available in supervisor
